      "text": "~14:40\nRESOLVED\n\nNew nodes decommissioned\none at a time, ~8-10 min\neach. ~90 min total from\nfirst alert.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
