    },
    {
      "id": "t_callout",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 315,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752451200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE ACTUAL BUG\nauto_bootstrap is supposed to keep a joining node \"inactive\": assigned a slice of data, but not serving\nreads/writes for it until that data has actually streamed over. Monzo's new nodes skipped the inactive part\nand started serving immediately — for data they didn't yet hold.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE ACTUAL BUG\nauto_bootstrap is supposed to keep a joining node \"inactive\": assigned a slice of data, but not serving\nreads/writes for it until that data has actually streamed over. Monzo's new nodes skipped the inactive part\nand started serving immediately — for data they didn't yet hold.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "b_changed",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 110,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3730a3",
      "backgroundColor": "#eef2ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [{ "id": "t_changed", "type": "text" }],
      "updated": 1752451200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "t_changed",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 445,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752451200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT CHANGED\nFixed the auto_bootstrap configuration. Documented every Cassandra setting in real runbooks. Committed to\nsplitting the single 21-node cluster into several smaller ones — not because smaller is safer, but because a\nsmaller blast radius is faster to diagnose.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHAT CHANGED\nFixed the auto_bootstrap configuration. Documented every Cassandra setting in real runbooks. Committed to\nsplitting the single 21-node cluster into several smaller ones — not because smaller is safer, but because a\nsmaller blast radius is faster to diagnose.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0f766e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752451200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nobody set auto_bootstrap wrong on purpose. It's the kind of assumption that's correct right up until the day it's\ntested for real, on a live system, with customers' money running through it.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nobody set auto_bootstrap wrong on purpose. It's the kind of assumption that's correct right up until the day it's\ntested for real, on a live system, with customers' money running through it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    }
  ],
